      "description": {
        "fun": "Necrozma was once a radiant being of light, until it was badly wounded and lost its light; the shards that rained down on Alola may be the Z-Crystals people use today. Now black with impurities and in constant, maddening pain, it steals light wherever it can, and ancient people feared it as the 'pillager of light'. It hunts Solgaleo and Lunala for their endless energy, and they chase it to win their light back.",
        "guide": "Necrozma is a Psychic-type Legendary Pokémon from Ultra Space and the mascot of Ultra Sun and Ultra Moon. It absorbs light to survive and can fuse with Solgaleo or Lunala to become Dusk Mane or Dawn Wings Necrozma. With the Ultranecrozium Z, it can return to its true form, Ultra Necrozma.",
        "tagline": "A shattered prism creature desperate to steal back its light",
